the Wide is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows Booming.

the Narrow is a contract.
this allows Saved.

the Game is an actor.
this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Wide.
    if input exists?
        this is Saved!
    or?
        this is Booming!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    that is Narrow.
    do this's Inner with input...
        when that is Saved?
            this is that!
        or?
            this is Saved!

the App is a script.

do Game's Outer with "x"...
    when that is Saved?
        log "saved-y".
    or?
do Game's Outer...
    when that is Saved?
        log "saved-n".
    or?
